# Build intermediates produced by regenerate.sh.
#
# The three `.ct` directories and `session.toml` ARE committed — they are
# the recordings the tests consume, and re-recording them on every CI run
# would make the suite depend on a full browser + Rust toolchain. These
# entries are the artefacts used to *produce* those recordings, which are
# reproducible from source and would otherwise add tens of megabytes.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/package-lock.json
frontend/balance_calc.wasm
frontend/balance_calc.wasm.manifest.json
wasm-src/target/

# Dropped into the directory by the nix dev shell's git hooks.
.pre-commit-config.yaml
